        "original_id": "77996a43-c988-5d8d-811e-9257b64b1f3f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2014–15 UEFA Champions League knockout phase, 2015 UEFA Champions League Final\n- Organizations: UEFA\n- Places: Olympiastadion, Berlin, Germany\n- Topics: UEFA Champions League\n\nFacts:\n- The 2014–15 UEFA Champions League knockout phase began on 17 February 2015.\n- The 2015 UEFA Champions League Final concluded the 2014–15 UEFA Champions League knockout phase on 6 June 2015 at Olympiastadion in Berlin, Germany.\n- The 2015 UEFA Champions League Final decided the champions of the 2014–15 UEFA Champions League.\n- The 2015 UEFA Champions League Final was the final match of the 2014–15 UEFA Champions League.\n- UEFA organised the 2014–15 UEFA Champions League as the 60th season of Europe’s premier club football tournament.\n- The 2014–15 UEFA Champions League was the 23rd season since the European Champion Clubs' Cup was renamed the UEFA Champions League.",
